OL,5,G0335 The Cruise: Fun-Loving Brits at
OL,6,G     Sea
OL,7,     FThe travellers visit the island of
OL,8,     FSantorini, where they experience
OL,9,     Fthe black sands of Perissa beach,
OL,10,     Fa calamari lunch, Profitis Ilias
OL,11,     FMountain, and a salsa lesson.
OL,12,G0425 The Cruise: Fun-Loving Brits at
OL,13,G     Sea
OL,14,     FThe guests visit Messina, Sicily's
OL,15,     Fthird largest city, where they
OL,16,     Fenjoy a walking tour, arancini
OL,17,     Fstreet food, Fort San Jaccidhu
OL,18,     FEcological Park and the lakes of
OL,19,     FGanzirri.
